# BuildKit honors a "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" sibling of the Dockerfile and
# uses it INSTEAD of the context-root .dockerignore. This keeps the ipinfo image
# rules local to this directory.
#
# NOTE: patterns are still evaluated relative to the BUILD CONTEXT, which is the
# repository root (the Go module lives there and ipinfo imports its internal/
# packages) — hence the "ipinfo/..." prefixes below. Requires BuildKit.

.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
agent-rs/target
**/*.bak

# Prebuilt local binaries (rebuilt inside the image).
ipinfo/ipinfo
agent/agent

# Exclude all geodb data, then re-include only the files baked into the image.
ipinfo/geodb/**
!ipinfo/geodb/geolite2.mmdb
!ipinfo/geodb/geolite2_ipv4.parquet
!ipinfo/geodb/ip2proxy.mmdb
!ipinfo/geodb/ip2proxy_ipv4.parquet
